    "body": "Line: unified geometric route/action/learning integration · count4/3 · headline437/512 + opened0/128 -> unchanged (panel fitting).\n\nOwner explicitly requested completing the mathematical/learning design after the #2225 source repair and pivot card. Second preparation delivery for future `unified-bound-content-437`, NOT_RUN/not FIT-cleared. No count reset, mechanism closure or model promotion. No training, optimizer, inference, build, pod, fresh draw or diagnostic.\n\n## Design\n- One shared encoder/revision, role-specific compiler/key/query heads and all learned factors in one optimizer/export transaction. Live compiler features, not the old frozen-feature fit cache.\n- Original span writes into existing exact versioned store; predicted exact-address candidate plus bounded15-family E8/SpiralCore index, resident root/count moments, exact record residual and common native Copy/Generate/EOS pool. No hash metric, E8/H4 ID cast, duplicate memory engine or MoE.\n- Existing Claude bounded/shared candidate/content findings and E8 tables reused. DeepSeek #2228/#2229 adjacent address/control work credited, not duplicated or adopted as a semantic metric. Live SpiralCore source hash matches the prior hands-on audit.\n- Explicit stochastic hard-decision learning graph: synchronous H4 right-action transitions, separate observed120 roots/33 categories, compiler act/relation/span/view, source-root/family/donor choices and global shared prototypes. Actual delayed memory/reply suffix loss reaches prior write/root policies. Fixed exact bytes and pure frame changes get no fabricated derivative.\n- Native Q31 token masses vs offline smooth token sampling/native-anchored differential are explicit; greedy packed export remains qualification authority. No argmax/unbiased packed-model gradient/descent claim; finite120 local utilities cannot be counted twice.\n- Whole-path support/provenance/credit/rebinding/CUDA/causal gates. The512 two-record panel cannot judge compiler/store or larger routing; route-pressure admission rejects compute on an inactive branch. No criteria/panel/grader changes or endpoints chosen from diagnostics.\n\n## Exact-Head Documentation Checks\nHead ac402e3225240a1e3b3b4323a9bf9c2b27523f08, incorporates fresh main735d7579b.\n- Diff-check and claim-wording gate PASS.\n- Relative-link inventory PASS:9 targets across4 scoped documents.\n- Self-review against actual native right-action/readout phases, compiler positive-max contiguous-span law, store views, common native integer masses/aliases, SpiralCore/E8 action frames and current peer source. Corrected destination-vs-action logits, missing observation policy credit and native-mass-vs-exp confusion before delivery.\n- No Rust changes; no compile/model tests. Prior16 #2225 source fixture PASS is not attributed to this design. This is not TEST FITNESS for compute.\n\n## Decision And Cost\nKEEP design; joint trainer implementation NOT YET QUALIFIED. Opposite outcome: an unresolved branch/support/frame/credit contradiction blocks implementation; a coherent contract permits the integrated implementation, never automatic compute. #2225 plus this design exhaust the two preparation PRs; no third prep/reading loop. Owner hold release, exact implementation gates and new preregistration/FIT precede training.\n\nDocs only, <=1GiB review RAM; initial64MiB marginal-doc projection corrected to2GiB temporary checkout reservation before further work (actual1.3GiB tracked source/assets, disk40GiB). $0 new owned paid compute, no worker/lease. Complete nonoverlapping tail after02:00UTC is charged atop1,625,052,185 /1,650,772,756ms, including design/errors/review/wait/delivery/cloud/cleanup; no reset or new model admission from the unavailable legacy ledger. Final immutable receipts on2030/2037. Protected merge/tree verification and branch/worktree/hygiene cleanup required.\n\nCanonical docs/labs/whole-path-learning-2026-10-11/{README,DESIGN}.md, current-state/mechanism/source-record/README/STATUS/ROADMAP synchronized; peer entries preserved.\n\nReferences #2030. Does not close M2 or the continuous goal.\n",
