      "body": "Exact-head self-review: ac402e3225240a1e3b3b4323a9bf9c2b27523f08.\n\nDocumentation only. Diff-check/claim-wording and9 relative link targets PASS. No source compile, optimizer, model call, panel, fresh draw or paid compute; #2225's16 source fixtures remain scoped to that PR.\n\nReviewed probability/causality/geometry identities against native source: Context selects RIGHT actions from OLD own/neighbor, synchronously composes, then independently observes120 roots/33 categories from NEW states; compiler maximum-positive contiguous interval preserves original spans; four store views/statuses are distinct; native emission masses are Q31 integer lookups, not exp softmax; sampled pooled-token law differs explicitly from greedy serving. Global prototype draw logged once per batch; actual conditional without-replacement route law/baseline/support recorded; coefficient partials and discrete-policy terms not duplicated. Delay loss reaches early write/source-root decisions. All learned dependencies rebind together, with no weakened stale compiler/snapshot guard.\n\nFrame group algebra and exact content residual are preserved; E8 orbit profile is a lossy finite-geometric analogue, not literal elliptic Frobenius arithmetic or an H4/E8 isometry. Within-orbit representative intervention is distinguished from common-frame invariance and topology null. Rings can truncate eligibility without evicting exact payload. Current512/two relations cannot judge route pressure; gates reject an unexercised test. Serving expert networks/transformer/helper/audio loop are not adopted.\n\nNo remaining blocking contradiction found in this design scope. It is not an implemented/qualified joint trainer, predictive/cost evidence or TEST FITNESS for a numerical recipe. Source/data/CUDA gates, preregistration/FIT and owner hold release remain required. Count4/3, no reset; design delivery2/2 for named future run. No third preparation PR implied. References #2030, not Closes.\n",
